* @title Gimpel one-way cipher function
* @attribution James F. Gimpel, Algorithms in SNOBOL4, Chapter 16.4; Catspaw SNOBOL4+ program diskette
* @expect >>>
* O
* GJ
* 2JD
* 1CC32T0L
* MLANKL
* 1CC32T0L
* <<<
-INCLUDE "ONEWAY.INC"
	OUTPUT = ONEWAY('A')
	OUTPUT = ONEWAY('AB')
	OUTPUT = ONEWAY('ABC')
	OUTPUT = ONEWAY('PASSWORD')
	OUTPUT = ONEWAY('SECRET')
	OUTPUT = ONEWAY('PASSWORD')
END
